                            <comment id="501289" author="gerrit" created="Wed, 9 Sep 2026 15:08:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&quot;Marc Vef &amp;lt;mvef@whamcloud.com&amp;gt;&quot; uploaded a new patch: &lt;a href=&quot;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/68747&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/68747&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Subject: &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20718&quot; title=&quot;Interop sanity-pfl test_18: Add component to /mnt/lustre/f18.sanity-pfl-1 failed 3 &quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-20718&quot;&gt;LU-20718&lt;/a&gt; llapi: ignore stale EC fields from old servers&lt;br/&gt;
